3.8,"liab_to_assets":59,"cash_to_assets":39.1,"current_ratio":13.05,"roe":18,"roa":8,"moat":{"ticker":"ASTS","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"ASTS 處於一個高度競爭的電信市場，其品牌知名度尚在建立階段，尚未形成強大的品牌護城河。雖然其技術具有創新性，但消費者對衛星通訊的品牌忠誠度尚未成熟，定價權也受限於市場的價格敏感度和潛在的競爭者定價策略。目前，品牌和定價能力相對較弱，難以支撐顯著的溢價。","comment_en":"ASTS operates in a highly competitive telecommunications market, and its brand recognition is still in the nascent stages, lacking a strong brand moat. While its technology is innovative, consumer brand loyalty in satellite communication is not yet established, and pricing power is constrained by market price sensitivity and potential competitor pricing strategies. Currently, brand and pricing capabilities are relatively weak, making it difficult to command significant premiums."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ASTS 在衛星通訊技術領域擁有關鍵的專利組合，特別是其直接連接手機的技術，這構成了重要的技術壁壘。監管批准和頻譜分配是進入此市場的必要條件，ASTS 已在多個國家獲得了關鍵的監管批准，這為其運營提供了重要的許可。然而，專利訴訟和監管環境的變化仍是潛在風險。","comment_en":"ASTS possesses a crucial patent portfolio in satellite communication technology, particularly its direct-to-device technology, which forms a significant technical barrier. Regulatory approvals and spectrum allocation are necessary prerequisites for market entry. ASTS has secured key regulatory approvals in multiple countries, providing a vital license for its operations. However, patent litigation and evolving regulatory landscapes remain potential risks."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"對於終端用戶而言，更換至 ASTS 的服務可能涉及購買新的兼容設備或支付額外費用，這構成了一定的轉換成本。然而，相較於傳統電信服務，用戶轉換的門檻可能不高，尤其是在服務普及初期。若 ASTS 能提供顯著的差異化優勢或與設備製造商深度綁定，轉換成本有望提升。","comment_en":"For end-users, switching to ASTS's service might involve purchasing new compatible devices or incurring additional costs, creating a moderate switching cost. However, compared to traditional telecom services, the barrier to user transition may not be excessively high, especially in the early stages of service adoption. If ASTS can offer significant differentiation or deep integration with device manufacturers, switching costs could potentially increase."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"ASTS 的網絡效應體現在其衛星網絡的規模和覆蓋範圍。隨著更多用戶和設備接入網絡，網絡的價值會增加，吸引更多用戶。與手機製造商的合作夥伴關係也加強了這種網絡效應。然而，相較於傳統社交網絡或平台，其網絡效應的強度和擴散速度可能較慢。","comment_en":"ASTS's network effects are manifested in the scale and coverage of its satellite network. As more users and devices connect to the network, its value increases, attracting further adoption. Partnerships with mobile manufacturers also strengthen these network effects. However, compared to traditional social networks or platforms, the intensity and speed of network effect diffusion might be slower."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"隨著衛星網絡的部署和運營規模的擴大，ASTS 有望實現顯著的規模經濟效益，從而降低單位用戶的運營成本。其獨特的低軌衛星設計和分佈式架構可能帶來成本優勢。然而，初期的高昂資本支出是顯著的挑戰，規模優勢的完全體現需要時間和持續的擴張。","comment_en":"As the deployment and operational scale of its satellite network expand, ASTS is poised to achieve significant economies of scale, thereby reducing the per-user operating costs. Its unique low-Earth orbit satellite design and distributed architecture may offer cost advantages. However, the substantial initial capital expenditure presents a significant challenge, and the full realization of scale advantages requires time and continuous expansion."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"ASTS 的核心資產是其遍佈全球的衛星網絡和獲得的頻譜權。這種全球性的覆蓋能力，特別是在傳統地面網絡難以到達的地區，構成了獨特的地理資產壁壘。與各國監管機構的合作和獲得的運營許可，使其能夠在全球範圍內提供服務，這是其他競爭對手難以快速複製的。","comment_en":"ASTS's core assets are its globally distributed satellite network and acquired spectrum rights. This global coverage capability, especially in regions difficult for traditional terrestrial networks to reach, constitutes a unique geographical asset barrier. Collaborations with regulatory bodies and obtained operating licenses enable it to provide services worldwide, a feat difficult for competitors to replicate quickly."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"ASTS 的運營效率體現在其創新的衛星技術和地面設施的整合。其低軌衛星設計旨在降低發射和運營成本。然而，作為一個新興的運營商，其運營效率仍有待在大規模商業運營中得到充分驗證。與現有電信運營商的合作夥伴關係有助於提升其運營效率和市場滲透。","comment_en":"ASTS's operational efficiency is reflected in its innovative satellite technology and integrated ground infrastructure. Its low-Earth orbit satellite design aims to reduce launch and operational costs. However, as an emerging operator, its operational efficiency still needs to be fully validated through large-scale commercial operations. Partnerships with existing telecom operators can help enhance its operational efficiency and market penetration."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ASTS 的資本配置策略聚焦於衛星網絡的建設和擴張，以及與戰略夥伴的合作。公司通過融資和戰略合作來獲取建設所需的大量資金。其對核心技術和網絡擴張的投入，顯示了對長期增長的重視。然而，高額的資本支出和盈利能力的實現是其資本配置面臨的關鍵挑戰。","comment_en":"ASTS's capital allocation strategy focuses on the construction and expansion of its satellite network, as well as collaborations with strategic partners. The company secures substantial funding for construction through financing and strategic partnerships. Its investment in core technology and network expansion demonstrates a focus on long-term growth. However, high capital expenditures and the realization of profitability are key challenges in its capital allocation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"ASTS 的客戶保留策略將依賴於其服務的穩定性、覆蓋範圍的廣泛性以及與設備的無縫集成。一旦用戶習慣了其無處不在的連接，並且服務穩定可靠，轉換成本會隨之增加。與手機製造商的深度合作，將有助於將其服務內嵌，從而提高用戶黏性。","comment_en":"ASTS's customer retention strategy will depend on the stability of its service, the breadth of its coverage, and seamless integration with devices. Once users become accustomed to its ubiquitous connectivity, and the service is stable and reliable, switching costs will naturally increase. Deep collaborations with mobile manufacturers will help embed its service, thereby enhancing user stickiness."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"ASTS 的商業模式具有一定的長期可持續性，特別是在滿足全球未被充分服務地區的連接需求方面。然而，技術快速迭代和潛在的新進入者是其商業模式面臨的主要挑戰。其衛星網絡的壽命和更新換代週期，也將影響其長期業務的持續性。","comment_en":"ASTS's business model possesses a degree of long-term sustainability, particularly in meeting the connectivity needs of underserved regions globally. However, rapid technological iteration and potential new entrants pose significant challenges to its business model. The lifespan and upgrade cycles of its satellite network will also impact the durability of its long-term business."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"ASTS 的護城河主要體現在其全球性的衛星網絡資產和關鍵技術專利，這使其在提供無縫全球連接方面具有獨特優勢，類似於一種\"收費橋\"模式，連接了地面網絡的盲點。其規模經濟效益和與手機製造商的合作夥伴關係，正逐步構建網絡效應和潛在的客戶黏性。然而，公司仍處於發展初期，面臨高昂的資本支出、技術迭代風險以及激烈的市場競爭，其品牌定價權和轉換成本尚不顯著。長期來看，若能成功擴大規模並維持技術領先，其護城河將日益堅固。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"ASTS's moat primarily lies in its global satellite network assets and key technological patents, granting it a unique advantage in providing seamless global connectivity, akin to a 'toll bridge' model connecting the blind spots of terrestrial networks. Its economies of scale and partnerships with mobile manufacturers are gradually building network effects and potential customer stickiness. However, the company is in its early stages, facing high capital expenditures, technological obsolescence risks, and intense market competition. Its brand pricing power and switching costs are not yet significant. In the long term, if it can successfully scale and maintain technological leadership, its moat will become increasingly robust.","evidenceHash":"430863f5fa7a113b83c8ed6f65b40f498700162d590090cea308c2060a879132","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ASTS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ASTS.png","website":"https://ast-science.com","ceo":"Abel Avellan","full_time_employees":"1126","description":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. establishes and operates a satellite-based cellular broadband network designed to connect directly with standard mobile phones. Through its SpaceMobile service, it delivers mobile internet access to individuals in remote or unserved locations that lack traditional terrestrial mobile coverage, whether on land, across oceans, or during air travel. The company is situated in Midland, Texas.","description_en":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. establishes and operates a satellite-based cellular broadband network designed to connect directly with standard mobile phones. Through its SpaceMobile service, it delivers mobile internet access to individuals in remote or unserved locations that lack traditional terrestrial mobile coverage, whether on land, across oceans, or during air travel. The company is situated in Midland, Texas.","description_zh":"**AST SpaceMobile, Inc. (ASTS) 業務營運精煉報告**\n\nAST SpaceMobile, Inc. 致力於建置並營運一個創新的衛星行動寬頻網路，其核心目標是實現與現有標準智慧型手機的直接連接。透過其「SpaceMobile」服務，該公司旨在為傳統地面行動網路無法觸及的偏遠地區、海上或空中旅程中的使用者，提供無縫的行動網際網路存取。\n\n其主要業務板塊聚焦於衛星通訊技術的研發與部署，特別是其獨特的「Direct-to-Device」衛星技術，能夠讓普通手機無需額外硬體即可直接與衛星通訊。營運模式上，AST SpaceMobile 採取與全球行動營運商（MNOs）合作的策略，透過與其建立夥伴關係，將其衛星網路整合至現有行動通訊生態系統中，進而擴大服務範圍並創造營收。此舉有助於解決全球數十億人口的「數位落差」問題，提供真正無處不在的行動連網解決方案。","address":"Midland Intl. Air & Space Port","city":"Midland","state":"TX","zip":"79706","country":"US","phone":"432 276 3966","full_address":"Midland Intl. Air & Space Port, Midland, TX 79706, US","range_52w":"38.88-133.86","year_high":133.86,"year_low":38.88,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":38.88,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-19","name":"Bernal Maya","title":"officer: Chief Accounting Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":3935,"price":40.66,"total_val":0.16},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Thorsen Wayne","title":"officer: EVP & Chief Commercial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":200000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Thorsen Wayne","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Yao Huiwen","title":"officer: Chief Technology Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":40000,"price":58.93,"total_val":2.36},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Gupta Shanti B.","title":"officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":12000,"price":58.89,"total_val":0.71},{"date":"2026-09-01","name":"Cisneros Adriana","title":"director","is_buy":true,"action":"P-Purchase","shares":670,"price":58.87,"total_val":0.04},{"date":"2026-09-01","name":"Cisneros Adriana","title":"director","is_buy":true,"action":"P-Purchase","shares":8768,"price":57,"total_val":0.5},{"date":"2026-09-01","name":"Cisneros Adriana","title":"director","is_buy":true,"action":"P-Purchase","shares":1384,"price":57.79,"total_val":0.08},{"date":"2026-08-24","name":"Turco Christopher Edward","title":"officer: EVP and Chief of Staff","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":200000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"Yao Huiwen","title":"officer: Chief Technology Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"X-InTheMoney","shares":40000,"price":0.06,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"ASTS","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc.","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-22T14:07:46.564Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/ASTS.json"}},"snapshot":null,"model":null}
